  "name": "EU Energy and Environment Sub-Committee",
  "parent_committee_id": 176,
  "purpose": "<p>This sub-committee ceased to exist on 23 April 2020, when The European Union Committee <a href=\"https://committees.parliament.uk/committee/176/european-union-committee/news/146098/new-subcommittees-appointed-by-the-european-union-committee/\">adopted a new structure</a> to reflect the United Kingdom's changed relationship with the European Union.</p>\r\n<p>The new EU Environment Committee can be found at <a href=\"https://committees.parliament.uk/committee/444/eu-environment-subcommittee/\">EU Environment Sub-Committee</a></p>",
